at you will heal some stuff that's been lingering far too long. Heal soul wounds in this place and let it not pass down to the next generation. </p><p>Lord God, we cancel every demonic assignment from our families in the name of Jesus. We cancel every single demonic assignment and every generational curse. We call it null and void in the name of Jesus that you cannot persist. You will not work any longer. Lord, we ask that you would bring us out from among any and every generational curse, oh Lord. And to replace those curses, we ask, Lord, that you will send generational blessings. Generational blessings. Generational blessings of the mind, of the heart, of the soul, of faith, of wealth, oh Lord, of health. of gratitude, of thanksgiving, oh Lord, generational wealth, Lord God, generational blessings of tithing and investing and sowing into people's lives and serving, oh Lord, generational blessings of joy, abounding, abounding, abounding, abounding in the name of Jesus Christ. to every spirit of anxiety and depression that has tried to attack people in this room and those that are connected to you, we command you to leave right now in the name of Jesus. Healing, healing, hope and light and truth flood this place in the name of Jesus, in the name of Jesus, in the name of Jesus. </p><p>And Lord, even every spiritual baby within people's souls, oh God, We ask, God, that you would resurrect some dead dreams, resurrect some dead faith, O God, in the name of Jesus. We ask, Lord, that you would bring greater spiritual fertility than we've ever had, O God. We pray, Lord, God, that stuff that has come to bring barrenness of the soul and barrenness of the body, we command you to leave in the name of Jesus. Amen. In the name of Jesus. In the name of Jesus. And we speak life and health and spiritual fertility and biological fertility in the name of Jesus. We plead the blood of Jesus over every cell, every organ of our bodies. And all those in our bloodline. </p><p>In the name 