 <blockquote><p><em>Let everything that has breath praise Yah! Praise Yah!</em></p><p>Psalm 150:6, World English Bible</p></blockquote>
 
 <p>The World English Bible translates it "Praise Yah!" In the New Testament it appears only in Revelation 19, where the crowds of heaven shout "Hallelujah!" around the throne.</p>
