+<p><strong>You hear God's voice by treating prayer as a conversation instead of a speech.</strong> God speaks most often through Scripture, through the quiet prompting of the Holy Spirit, through other believers, and through circumstances that line up with what He has already said. Hearing Him starts with believing He wants to talk with you, then slowing down long enough to listen.</p>
