+<p>Ask almost anyone, "Have you ever prayed?" and most will say yes. Even people who do not consider themselves religious reach out to God in a crisis. But ask, "Do you hear God's voice?" and most people pause. For many, prayer feels like a message sent into the sky with no idea if it was received. That gap between saying prayers and actually hearing God is one of the reasons we wrote this book.</p>
+
+<h3>God Has Always Been a Speaking God</h3>
