 <p>We are formed for a purpose. But what does it look like to actually walk in that purpose when everything around you is pushing back? Paul's first letter to Timothy gives us a window into how God forms us for a purpose and keeps us aligned to it.</p>
+<aside class="mid-cta next-step"><div class="eyebrow">Your next step &middot; Free 21-day Bible plan</div><h3>The Surrendered Mind</h3><p>21 days of letting go and being led. Every one of us hands our mind over to something, whether it is our plans, our fears, or the voices that tell us who we are.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.bible.com/reading-plans/79619-the-surrendered-mind" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start the Plan in the Bible App <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a></div></aside>
