e, it becomes a place of flourishing that impacts entire communities and generations.</p><p>So let's pray and believe—for the Lord to build our homes, His spiritual house at GateCity Buckhead, for the church throughout Atlanta to flourish, and for our city to find mercy and favor in God's sight.</p><p><em>Unless the Lord builds the house, we labor in vain. But when He builds—families flourish, churches thrive, and cities are transformed.</em></p>
